    "scope": "full",
    "basis": "A seeded uniform scale of the figure about its feet, sd 3.5 % (about 6 cm on the 1.75 m engineering body), clipped at 7 %. Reconstructed: it spreads the town's adults about the body every figure shares; no measured stature of any resident is asserted."
